        <li>Splunk monitors infrastructure, security, applications, usage, and operations.</li>
        <li>Cisco invoices the enterprise as merchant of record.</li>
        <li>Cisco attributes usage to the model builder and infrastructure provider.</li>
        <li>Cisco settles the appropriate partner economics.</li>
        <li>The enterprise receives one Cisco-led commercial, security, governance, observability, and support experience.</li>
